('1eeb09ae-4966-11f1-a796-e00af6a25786', '2026-05-06 23:10:37.000000', 1, 10, '{\"question\":\"How do you say I think in Chinese?\",\"options\":[\"Wo juéde\",\"Wo juéwàng\",\"Wo juédìng\",\"Wo rènwéi\"],\"correctIndex\":0,\"explanation\":\"觉得 (juéde) means to think or feel. Wo juéde = I think.\"}', 20, 'How to express opinion?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'e4a43986-4952-11f1-a796-e00af6a25786'),
